---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { path } from '../data/stages';
---
<Base title="About" description="About AI4LA, a practical guide to AI in landscape architecture.">
  <div class="shell page-width">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT AI4LA</p>
      <h1>A place to test ideas<span class="period">.</span></h1>
      <p>AI4LA organizes articles by the work landscape architects actually do: research, analysis, concept design, development, visualization, and communication.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <h2>How to use this site</h2>
      <p>Start with the stage of your project. Each article focuses on one task and explains where AI can help, what to check yourself, and how to keep the design decision in your hands.</p>
      <p>Articles bring together practical methods, case studies, and references, with attention to verification and the limits of each tool. Contributions are welcome through the email link in each workflow.</p>
      <p><a href={path('/#workflow')}>Browse the workflow →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
